20:07.840 --> 20:09.000
Que había frío.

20:09.000 --> 20:12.240
Where was it again?

20:12.240 --> 20:14.400
It's in Gainesville.

20:14.400 --> 20:17.080
But it's like twenty minutes from where they live.

20:17.080 --> 20:21.000
Oh.

20:21.000 --> 20:23.400
So it's in the outside of Gainesville.

20:23.400 --> 20:24.600
So it's not that far.

20:24.600 --> 20:27.200
No, no, no, no, it's not far away.

20:27.200 --> 20:28.920
But it's in the outside of Gainesville.

20:28.920 --> 20:31.720
Y tú tío mandó ahora por correo un CD con todas las fotos de Ecuador.

20:31.720 --> 20:33.920
Te acuerdas que aquel día que las vimos las...

20:33.920 --> 20:35.600
Oh yeah.

20:35.600 --> 20:38.040
