21:40.880 --> 21:41.880
Mhmm.

21:41.880 --> 21:45.240
All the beautiful flowers that they have.

21:45.240 --> 21:46.800
Mhmm.

21:46.800 --> 21:47.760
Y...

21:47.760 --> 21:49.120
Y eso que la Angie, la perrita de ellos, estaba comiendo las flores.

21:49.120 --> 21:50.560
Todas las flores se las come.

21:50.560 --> 21:53.240
Deja las matas sin flores.

21:53.240 --> 21:55.760
Esa Angie, she's a trip.

21:55.760 --> 21:57.800
She's so cute.

21:57.800 --> 21:59.080
She's too much.

