22:06.360 --> 22:09.040
She's jealous.

22:13.840 --> 22:15.160
Sí. Ella...

22:15.160 --> 22:15.720
Y cuando estamos sentados en el sofá, Eduardo y yo, a nosotros.

22:15.720 --> 22:20.960
Ella nunca ha acostado arriba a ti en la casa.

22:20.960 --> 22:22.800
Yeah.

22:22.800 --> 22:23.720
She always did.

22:23.720 --> 22:25.840
But her head weighed more than her body entirely.

22:25.840 --> 22:29.520
Yeah, she's very heavy.

22:29.520 --> 22:30.120
Think her head just weighs more than me.

22:30.120 --> 22:32.000
She is heavy.

22:32.000 --> 22:34.040
Oye, esta noche es Don Francisco.

22:34.080 --> 22:37.680
Hace tiempo que no ves el programa Don Francisco.

22:37.680 --> 22:41.000
No, pero you know...

22:41.000 --> 22:41.840
I don't know.

22:41.840 --> 22:43.440
El otro día yo estaba en el play ese que, que tú me viste.

22:43.440 --> 22:46.200
Aha.

22:46.200 --> 22:46.760
You were good in there.

22:46.760 --> 22:48.920
I like it.

22:48.920 --> 22:50.720
I think you're gonna be an actress.

22:50.720 --> 22:52.160
Hopefully.

22:52.160 --> 22:54.240
Would you like to be one?

22:54.240 --> 22:55.480
Oh yeah.

22:55.480 --> 22:56.800
That's my dream.

22:56.800 --> 22:58.800
Really, Paula?

22:58.800 --> 23:01.960
Ay, Paula, todos los artistas pasan hambre, hijita.

23:01.960 --> 23:03.520
