23:05.480 --> 23:06.320
Tu abuela Ana siempre está de dieta.

23:06.320 --> 23:07.120
Ah, Ana cada día está más flaquita.

23:07.120 --> 23:07.880
Ay mi madre, qué flaquita está Ana.

23:07.880 --> 23:10.160
Yeah, but she's taking good care of herself now.

23:10.160 --> 23:13.240
She's skinny.

23:13.240 --> 23:16.000
¿Cuánto pesa Ana?

23:16.000 --> 23:18.800
Creo que cien libras.

23:18.800 --> 23:20.000
She, she weighs, I think, a hundred and fifteen pounds.

23:20.000 --> 23:21.080
Not even that.

23:21.080 --> 23:23.000
I think less than that.

23:23.000 --> 23:23.760
I think she does.

23:23.760 --> 23:24.720
Ah, my aunt weighs more than that.

23:24.720 --> 23:28.640
Sí, tu tía pesa un poquito más.

23:28.640 --> 23:29.920
So, abuela.

23:29.920 --> 23:33.360
¿Quién te a ti artista?

23:33.400 --> 23:34.760
Watch me.

23:34.760 --> 23:36.080
You'll see me on the big screen soon.

23:36.080 --> 23:38.120
