24:11.640 --> 24:13.520
Ehm, since December.

24:13.520 --> 24:14.360
Since December?

24:14.360 --> 24:16.600
How come I didn't notice before?

24:16.600 --> 24:18.440
Because I did it my first time in December before the cruise.

24:18.440 --> 24:23.320
Before the cruise?

24:23.320 --> 24:25.560
Ay, Paula.

24:25.560 --> 24:28.080
Up to where are you shaving?

24:28.080 --> 24:30.880
Oh, no, no.

24:30.880 --> 24:34.240
Madre mía.

24:34.240 --> 24:35.560
Así que tú quieres ser una artista?

24:35.560 --> 24:38.920
Imagínate de hambre de morirás.

24:38.920 --> 24:40.440
Yo.

24:40.440 --> 24:41.840
And how do you know?

24:41.840 --> 24:43.840
Porque todas las artistas tienen que estar flacas, hija, el televisor.

24:43.840 --> 24:44.560
Mira, pobre Don Francisco, Don Francisco, nada más que come pitta bread con pollo.

